Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:37:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] klee: Halium base for Linux userspace (UBports delta,
 without Ubuntu AppArmor)

binder, SysV IPC kept out of task_struct (KMI), GKI module quirks so
HyperOS's vendor modules load, Bluetooth hci_sync fix, LSM choice
between normal boot and recovery (OrangeFox needs SELinux). The Ubuntu
AppArmor extensions (Lomiri click confinement) are left out.
